# Input graph for the `domaine_path` parameter of `visualisation` (see driver.py).
# Holds 2 instance(s) of :Domaine, the class the region's query on g_domaine selects,
# and a neighbourhood that this query must not match: instances of the five
# other tracked classes (so a query wired to the wrong graph, or a file parsed
# into the wrong graph, changes the result), the class reached by another
# predicate than rdf:type, and a same-named class in another namespace.
@prefix : <http://dig.isi.edu/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:domaine_1 a :Domaine .
:domaine_2 a :Domaine .

:tache_in_domaine a :Tache .
:activite_in_domaine a :Activite .
:historique_in_domaine a :Generation .
:phenomene_in_domaine a :Phenomene_Metier .
:strategie_in_domaine a :Strategie .
:domaine_seeAlso rdfs:seeAlso :Domaine .
<http://other.example/domaine_9> a <http://other.example/Domaine> .
